WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.068
-Republicans are already rushing

00:00:02.068 --> 00:00:03.670
to fill the Supreme Court seat

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.039
left by Justice
Ruth Bader Ginsburg

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.375
and forced through a
conservative super majority

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.644
that will help them cement
minority rule for a generation.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:14.147
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look.".

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:18.084 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:21.788
So yesterday, a friend of mine
gave my youngest son an apple,

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.556
and he showed him
how you could shine it

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:25.424
by rubbing it on your shirt
like this.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.259
And then my son
started doing it,

00:00:27.259 --> 00:00:29.629
but he did it after each bite
he took,

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:32.432
thus covering himself
in apple juice.

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:34.100
Each time,
we tried to explain to him,

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:35.868
"That's not how you're
supposed to do it,"

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:37.536
he just laughed harder
and harder.

00:00:37.536 --> 00:00:40.239
My point is I'm glad that
also happened this weekend,

00:00:40.239 --> 00:00:42.608
because otherwise,
this weekend was the worst.

00:00:42.608 --> 00:00:46.045
There are few words left to say
about Ruth Bader Ginsburg's

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:47.814
legacy that haven't already been
said.

00:00:47.814 --> 00:00:50.149
She's a feminist icon
who was already

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.751
the leading litigator
for women's rights

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:54.587
in the country before
she joined the high court

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:57.489
and became one of its most
iconic and influential justices,

00:00:57.489 --> 00:00:59.525
and in addition to everything
else she accomplished,

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:01.994
she was also a fierce defender
of democracy.

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:04.330
For example, she delighted
audiences by brandishing

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.333
the pocket Constitution
she carried with her

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:08.735
wherever she went.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:12.538
-So, if I take out my pocket
Constitution,

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:17.477
which it carry with me wherever
I go in the world...

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:18.411
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.411 --> 00:01:20.213
So here it is.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:22.548
-Amazing. She was
as knowledgeable

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:24.650
about the Constitution
as anyone in history,

00:01:24.650 --> 00:01:26.352
and yet out of reverence
for the document,

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:27.820
she still carried it around
with her.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:31.290
Watching RBG reach into her tote
bag for her pocket Constitution

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:33.726
is like watching Batman
reach into his utility belt

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:35.695
for his grappling hook.
And of course,

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.196
you'd never see the latter,
because no matter

00:01:37.196 --> 00:01:39.198
where you stand on Batman,
he clearly lacks

00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:42.201
the crowd-pleasing
show-and-tell warmth of RBG.

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:44.504
And she was Brooklyn,
so something tells me

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:46.372
she busted that thing out a lot.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.174
"'Scuse me, lady.
You can't park here!"

00:01:48.174 --> 00:01:50.342
"Let me just take out
my pocket Constitution."

00:01:50.342 --> 00:01:52.211
"Oh [bleep] It's RBG!
Run, boys!"

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.647
Ginsburg was an incisive jurist

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:57.249
and legal pioneer
as recently as May.

00:01:57.249 --> 00:02:00.086
She called into the
Supreme Courts oral arguments

00:02:00.086 --> 00:02:02.154
from her hospital bed
to advocate

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:05.125
for Obamacare's protections
for access to contraception.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.794
-She kept attending
oral arguments.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:10.329
When the arguments
