00:02:10.329 --> 00:02:13.332
after the COVID pandemic,

00:02:13.332 --> 00:02:16.635
really shut down this court
in March,

00:02:16.635 --> 00:02:19.338
Justice Ginsburg
continued to participate.

00:02:19.338 --> 00:02:23.709
In fact, it was in May when she
had the gallbladder condition

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:25.211
