00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:34.087
Incredible. Not only would I not
participate in a conference call

00:02:34.087 --> 00:02:36.422
if I were in the hospital,
I know multiple people

00:02:36.422 --> 00:02:38.257
who have pretended
they were in the hospital

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:39.726
to get out of conference calls,

00:02:39.726 --> 00:02:41.594
unless that is one of my writers

00:02:41.594 --> 00:02:43.296 line:0%
actually has something called

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:45.264 line:0%
Blort's disease.

00:02:45.264 --> 00:02:47.400
Ruth Bader Ginsburg
was an intellectual titan,

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.968
a tireless advocate of equality,

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.770
